{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/159282eb3952b092c7ea3975fdf24d23.avif?t=1767209871\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries of living in darkness have robbed your tribe of sight, but in return, you have gained extraordinary hearing. After a tragic turning point in your tribe\u2019s history, you must venture into uncharted caverns filled with monstrous threats. Armed only with a whip and your ability to &quot;see&quot; through sound, you must fight, navigate, and survive in this treacherous new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7db8495697aad64fa8e09701008eeca5.avif?t=1767209871\" width=771 height=69 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/a015e28dd5a727accdb7a82654e3581e.poster.avif?t=1767209871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/a015e28dd5a727accdb7a82654e3581e.webm?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/a015e28dd5a727accdb7a82654e3581e.mp4?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate pitch-black environments by generating sound waves that reveal your surroundings. Every movement, crack of your whip, or environmental noise helps you visualize the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/1f552bfa0e847e0edf11afc330a1a494.avif?t=1767209871\" width=772 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/3fe3c116cf7fca35e960716d9d9c07d5.poster.avif?t=1767209871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/3fe3c116cf7fca35e960716d9d9c07d5.webm?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave's twisting tunnels, towering chasms, and shifting paths can disorient even seasoned explorers. To avoid getting lost, you'll need to draw your own map\u2014or risk wandering in circles forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/0bcd3e6b20552f7e357ab2d6299ff2c4.avif?t=1767209871\" width=771 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/8a8cf7c0010de77f7f2379f400d4d9f7.poster.avif?t=1767209871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/8a8cf7c0010de77f7f2379f400d4d9f7.webm?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/8a8cf7c0010de77f7f2379f400d4d9f7.mp4?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While sound is your greatest asset, too much noise can overwhelm your senses. Use your whip wisely, or risk temporary deafness in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/af45e510b1643dd1e945b554cb925ede.avif?t=1767209871\" width=772 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/0ebc723b0a9aeabf3ef02d5a04fd14a7.poster.avif?t=1767209871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/0ebc723b0a9aeabf3ef02d5a04fd14a7.webm?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/0ebc723b0a9aeabf3ef02d5a04fd14a7.mp4?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your whip isn't just a weapon; it's a tool for traversal. Swing across chasms, disarm enemies, and strike with precision to gain the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388080?t=1767209871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767209871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/b96156fd2b18dcb123b9dddfee5d1ec028390e53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767209871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/b96156fd2b18dcb123b9dddfee5d1ec028390e53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767209871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3877560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/159282eb3952b092c7ea3975fdf24d23.avif?t=1767209871\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries of living in darkness have robbed your tribe of sight, but in return, you have gained extraordinary hearing. After a tragic turning point in your tribe\u2019s history, you must venture into uncharted caverns filled with monstrous threats. Armed only with a whip and your ability to &quot;see&quot; through sound, you must fight, navigate, and survive in this treacherous new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7db8495697aad64fa8e09701008eeca5.avif?t=1767209871\" width=771 height=69 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/a015e28dd5a727accdb7a82654e3581e.poster.avif?t=1767209871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/a015e28dd5a727accdb7a82654e3581e.webm?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/a015e28dd5a727accdb7a82654e3581e.mp4?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate pitch-black environments by generating sound waves that reveal your surroundings. Every movement, crack of your whip, or environmental noise helps you visualize the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/1f552bfa0e847e0edf11afc330a1a494.avif?t=1767209871\" width=772 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/3fe3c116cf7fca35e960716d9d9c07d5.poster.avif?t=1767209871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/3fe3c116cf7fca35e960716d9d9c07d5.webm?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave's twisting tunnels, towering chasms, and shifting paths can disorient even seasoned explorers. To avoid getting lost, you'll need to draw your own map\u2014or risk wandering in circles forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/0bcd3e6b20552f7e357ab2d6299ff2c4.avif?t=1767209871\" width=771 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/8a8cf7c0010de77f7f2379f400d4d9f7.poster.avif?t=1767209871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/8a8cf7c0010de77f7f2379f400d4d9f7.webm?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/8a8cf7c0010de77f7f2379f400d4d9f7.mp4?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While sound is your greatest asset, too much noise can overwhelm your senses. Use your whip wisely, or risk temporary deafness in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/af45e510b1643dd1e945b554cb925ede.avif?t=1767209871\" width=772 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/0ebc723b0a9aeabf3ef02d5a04fd14a7.poster.avif?t=1767209871\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/0ebc723b0a9aeabf3ef02d5a04fd14a7.webm?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/0ebc723b0a9aeabf3ef02d5a04fd14a7.mp4?t=1767209871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your whip isn't just a weapon; it's a tool for traversal. Swing across chasms, disarm enemies, and strike with precision to gain the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["EyeSight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/b54268a59549a63a259a0954116b5c9d186ebe80/header.jpg?t=1767209871","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"ht